        "node_id": "n_11_a63342",
        "thought_text": "Analyze the local trend of the input sequence (increasing, decreasing, or peak/valley). If the sequence is strictly increasing and not at 15, predict UP. If strictly decreasing and not at 0/1, predict DOWN. If it hits a peak or valley, the direction is forced. If the sequence is too short or ambiguous (e.g., single value not near boundaries), output -1.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "190111665812718100",
