        "node_id": "n_12_f80c47",
        "thought_text": "Use a sliding window approach to verify consistency. Generate all valid 30-day cycles, extract subsequences of length n, and compare them with the input. Count the number of valid alignments. If count is 1, determine the next step from that unique alignment. If count > 1 and next steps differ, return -1.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "190111665812718100",
