        "thought_text": "Generate the full 30-day cycle sequence and attempt to match the input array against every possible starting position (offset) in the cycle. If exactly one offset matches the input, check the next value in that specific cycle to determine UP or DOWN. If multiple offsets match, check if they all lead to the same direction; otherwise, output -1.",
