        "thought_text": "Analyze the input sequence by looking at the differences between consecutive elements. Determine if the sequence is strictly increasing, strictly decreasing, or ambiguous (e.g., a single point like '8' could be part of an ascent or descent). Use the known cycle boundaries (0, 15) to resolve ambiguity if the sequence hits a peak or valley.",
