        "thought_text": "Since the input length n is small (up to 92) and the cycle is fixed at 30 days, pre-calculate all valid subsequences of length n from the cycle. Filter these against the input data. If the set of valid next values contains only numbers greater than the last input, output UP; if only smaller, output DOWN; if mixed or empty (though guaranteed consistent), handle accordingly.",
